{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日、乃木メの方でタグを決めたのですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今度はブログ用にもタグを決めました〜✨\n取り急ぎのご連絡です☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#セトグッジョブログ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "セトグッジョブ × ブログ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "、、、、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めてこれからよろしくお願いします！⬆️💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "11/2はオンラインミート&グリート！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobAJ3SCf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、ありがとうございました😌♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はちょっと不安な部分とか、できてない部分とかも多くて、自分に落ち込みそうになるときもあったんですけど、皆さんがかけてくださる言葉に救われました！\nどんなときも、また頑張ろう！って思わせてくれるのは、いつも皆さんです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mob2FDS9V.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして皆さんのことが大好きです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#538「乃木坂工事中　大運動会」前編"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/-kutrc11lZE?si=ZIMObKYXpXeREGPr"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大運動会が放送されました🚩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見ていただけましたでしょうか？！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩方ともチームがごっちゃになって、\n全力で青春してきました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前回の体力測定のときでも感じましたが、やっぱり体を動かすと気持ちがいいですね🍃\n思いきり笑って走って、自然と元気がでました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここで高めたチームワークもこれからの活動にも活かせそうです😆✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後半もぜひお楽しみに！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "40th Single「ビリヤニ」個人PV🎥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "予告編が公開されました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/9knca0vIMNY?si=GrnWXHKuxtrJwcVV"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "TYPE-Bに特典映像が収録されます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイトルは、\n「私はアホ毛が欲しい」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "というそのままの通り、アホ毛を欲しがっているお話！\nでもでも考えると、深くていいストーリー？になってたりするかもしれません！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今回、\n山根良顕さんにご出演いただいております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にすごく朗らかな方で、ずっと柔らかい空気に包まれておりました！\nこの役にピッタリな方だなと感じました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobJ43bdg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobZ60Yq7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もどんな風に仕上がるのか、とても楽しみです♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふう！\n今日はブログのタグを報告できたので満足満足^_^♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きますね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださり\nありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も1日、お疲れさまでした🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}